\custom angle=det _element=details _classes=.cbox _endString=------ open
\custom angle=sum _mode=inline _element=summary _classes=.margin-init

!! `\custom` pragma + chained markers

''Important:'' the two `\custom` pragmas are at the very top of this tiddler (before any block content). Pragmas don't fire mid-tiddler.

The pragmas register two symbols on the » marker:
* `»det` -> details element with classes `.cbox`, opens by default, ends at `------`
* `»sum` -> summary element with class `.margin-init`, inline mode

!!! Demo (chained on one line)

»det »sum Title here
body line 1
body line 2
------

Trailing paragraph below the marker.